# KodLokasi API key for grid-code location lookup.
# Get your key from https://api.kodlokasi.my
#
# Option A — Pass via command line:
#   flutter run --dart-define=KODLOKASI_API_KEY=kl_your_key_here
#
# Option B — Set environment variable, then launch from VS Code:
#   $env:KODLOKASI_API_KEY = "kl_your_key_here"
#   code .
#   (then F5 → "Mission Router (Live APIs)")
#
# For a full build (with Google Maps):
#   flutter run --dart-define=GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIza... --dart-define=KODLOKASI_API_KEY=kl_your_key_here
